window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>Adrian Savage: I'm obsessed with popstar Laila Fitzgerald, the opener on my band’s world tour. I tried to stay away when my bandmate said he was crushing on her. But in trying to do the right thing by my best friend, I've done the wrong thing by myself. I've pushed Laila away so hard, she hates my guts. In fact, I’m pretty sure I’m her sworn enemy by now. The kicker? For a sick f*ck like me, that only makes me want her even more.</p> <p>The Hate Love Duet is a bundled set of two consecutive books: Falling Out of Hate With You (book 1) and Falling Into Love With You (book 2) to be listened to in order.</p>"; 
